{{{ enchanting SPOILERS lurking ahead }}}

i don't know of anyway to know this (within the game) except by
endless experimentation.  in this case, hints are hard to come by.

other effects are possible but the normal circumstance is that for
armor you can have 3 enchantments and then you take your chances,
namely 1/n for success where n is the current enchantment value.
typically, hackers end up with armor enchanted to +4, +5 or +6.

similarly for weapons, other effects are possible but the normal
routine is that you can have 5 enchantments and then you take your
chances, which in this case is 1/3 for success.  typically, weapons
end up at +6 or +8, however +11 or better is not out of reach.

